                                                "sense_id": "0d7cf191-5e07-33e0-97b6-24090a1bf8e2",
                                                "text": "As \"Kings of the Covers,\" they re-recorded happening disks by Elvis (\"Heartbreak Hotel\") […] and, for their most publicly-known pinching, THE JAYHAWKS (\"Stranded In The Jungle\")."
